        <p>
          Bulgaria offers the lowest corporate tax environment in the European Union alongside Cyprus and Hungary. However, Bulgaria couples this low rate with an equally modest personal income tax rate and capped social contributions, creating an exceptional legal framework under European tax directives.
        </p>

